Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:05.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這樣一來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:11.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你現在又成為ZAFT軍的話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:13.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後打算怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:16.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼在找我們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:18.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 那是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.44,0:00:20.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為想阻止你們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.77,0:00:21.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別再做那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:24.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Junius 7的事雖然我也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:28.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之後的混亂怎麼看都是聯合不對
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:34.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而PLANT為早日結束這些正拼命努力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.48,0:00:36.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你們卻…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.15,0:00:39.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道不只是在搞亂情況嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:42.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:45.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 那個拉克絲 克萊茵呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.83,0:00:50.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在PLANT的那個拉克絲怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.37,0:00:57.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且為什麼真正的她險些被協調者殺害？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.78,0:01:06.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是誰 為什麼要取她性命
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要不水落石出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:12.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我就無法相信PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.08,0:01:25.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是什麼地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:35.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:37.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.55,0:01:44.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.29,0:01:47.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閉ざした過去が今
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸を搖さぶるから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,求めるほど遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,置き去りの心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らは生きるほど何かを失って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それでも明日への
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢を捨てたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみの理由でさえも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,つよく抱きしめていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通りすぎた季節のその先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,なにがあるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Couse I never do not stopping my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Phase-25  罪之所在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.16,0:03:36.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是拉克絲 克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:42.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請冷靜下來聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.44,0:03:44.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,盡可以嘲笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.01,0:03:48.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你當然心知肚明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:50.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是情非得已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:54.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她的力量很強大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:57.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比我的強大許多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:07.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 只有現在也好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:11.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能代替此時不在的拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:14.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能幫上議長和大家的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:15.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就很開心了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:18.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能見到阿斯蘭,真的很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:24.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了結束戰爭而選擇不戰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.07,0:04:29.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,遠比選擇戰鬥來得艱難
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:35.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的話真希望我也能做點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:40.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這才是比什麼都難的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.57,0:04:43.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:51.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那如果真的是以拉克絲為目標
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:55.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實事關重大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:59.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…因此就不相信議長
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:02.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不相信PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:05.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是太草率了 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:07.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:12.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT也有很多思想不同的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:16.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就像Junius 7的犯人們一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:26.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那次襲擊或許也是議長所不知的極少數人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:28.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恣意妄為不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.09,0:05:30.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:34.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你該不會連這都不明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.83,0:05:39.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,話是沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:45.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之那件事 我回艦以後會再調查
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:48.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你們現在回奧布吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:52.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那你…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:56.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,若想阻止戰爭 避免奧布參戰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:59.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就先想辦法解決和聯合的條約吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:01.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等上戰場就太遲了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:06.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…我也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:10.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那…你不回來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:13.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不回Archangel？也不回奧布?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:23.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要奧布還能像以前那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:26.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總會走到一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:28.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.85,0:06:30.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經歸隊了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.37,0:06:32.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今 回不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:34.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:41.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:49.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那樣的話 你今後就會待在ZAFT
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:53.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續和聯合作戰嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:07:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到戰爭結束之前 這是不得已的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.43,0:07:08.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那也會像之前一樣 和奧布…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:13.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可能的話 我也不想攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:16.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那時只能戰鬥不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:20.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合在這裡的所作所為
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:22.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也都知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:25.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,必須阻止這一切
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:29.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以叫你趕快想法解決那條約
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:31.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓奧布退出
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:37.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:40.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我們也明白這些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:45.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我們不想讓奧布受到襲擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.39,0:07:46.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其實不止是奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:52.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭中受襲而失去的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:55.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是一去不返的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:08.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別盡說些自以為是的漂亮話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:13.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的雙手也已經奪去很多人的生命了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:24.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:31.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 真的已經夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:32.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:35.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:39.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不想攻擊 別逼我攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.97,0:08:49.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,離水 Minerva出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:52.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上升率3.2 路線10
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:55.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閃光彈在280高度散佈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.76,0:09:03.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就更是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.23,0:09:07.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別再做那種事 回奧布去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:09.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:32.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有些事即使能理解 也無法接受
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.87,0:09:35.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:03.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:12.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,F2呼叫各隊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:14.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認解除電力線起爆裝置
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.96,0:10:16.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,F5呼叫F1
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:17.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,二樓已佔領
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:18.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,F1 這裡是F3
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:21.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都腐爛了 氣味很重
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:26.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我真的沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:30.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,話雖如此 這是以防萬一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:36.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然現階段建築及周邊都未檢測出毒氣和病毒等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:38.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但誰知道會有什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:01.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過艦長也太大意了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:05.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然就讓你們倆單獨去那種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:08.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們好好檢查過了才進去的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.93,0:11:09.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:13.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 我已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:15.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.85,0:11:18.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？再休息一下也沒關係啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:22.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 真的沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:33.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,內部的檢查完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:36.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自爆裝置全部拆除
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.85,0:11:39.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有發現生物學方面異常
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.27,0:11:42.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:45.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說 到底怎麼回事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:48.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷出現的異常
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:51.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 是Saviour
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.33,0:12:15.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回港聽說你們出動了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:18.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 發生什麼事了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.15,0:12:26.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,高分子過濾器的庫存在十號倉庫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:29.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,後備氣輪機的安裝趕快做好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:31.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,補給班 把車讓一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:45.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧 沒想到我們這裡三台都有損傷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.71,0:12:49.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 但不返回蘇伊士直接在這裡修理
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:51.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話很棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.46,0:12:55.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然知道 但沒法子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.52,0:13:02.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果被打得體無完膚回去還有藉口
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:06.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但史黛拉他們還很有精神
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.61,0:13:11.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅阿諾克上校
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:13.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.28,0:13:15.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,關於羅德尼亞的實驗室
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:21.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出了些意外沒能廢棄掉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:24.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且還不巧地被ZAFT…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.26,0:13:28.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,接到通報後蘇伊士也很著急
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:30.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之告訴您一聲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:16.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底…這裡到底是什麼地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:23.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發生內亂了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.41,0:14:26.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為自爆與否的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.82,0:14:31.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但為什麼這種孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:51.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅德尼亞的實驗室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.95,0:14:55.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:58.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅德尼亞的實驗室是我們...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:00.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我們以前待的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:03.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:06.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還不巧地被ZAFT…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.88,0:15:07.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐說的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.82,0:15:20.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,64年7月
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.85,0:15:23.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,11名廢棄處分 3名入住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:27.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,8月 7名廢棄處分 5名入住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.75,0:15:29.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.73,0:15:38.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,試驗體的 也就是孩子的入住記錄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:47.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合的強化人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.17,0:15:49.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也應該聽說過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:03.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,厭惡遺傳基因操縱的聯合和Blue Cosmos
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.93,0:16:08.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,使用藥物和其他各種手段製造出的活著的兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:10.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為戰鬥而生的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:15.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就是試驗和製造設施
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:22.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了能與我們協調者對抗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:26.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用藥物和某種東西改造或強化肉體
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:30.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只進行戰鬥訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.62,0:16:37.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不適用或者跟不上的人會被毫不留情地淘汰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.13,0:16:42.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就是那樣的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:49.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.90,0:16:50.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧盧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.07,0:16:52.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.17,0:16:53.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼能冷靜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.23,0:16:56.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母親還在實驗室裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.84,0:17:10.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母...親 還在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:14.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傻瓜 奧盧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:19.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母親 母親
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:22.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會死的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:25.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母親
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.06,0:17:30.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,死…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:34.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 振作點 傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:37.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母親
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:40.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,死…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.51,0:17:44.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能死
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:46.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.65,0:17:51.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:55.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.96,0:18:00.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:03.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅阿諾克上校 請馬上來一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:04.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧盧 尼達他…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.85,0:18:12.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開艙門
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.52,0:18:15.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不打開我就炸開它
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:16.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.68,0:18:18.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦橋 出事了！ 快叫上校
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:20.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上校
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:34.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅德尼亞 實驗室 母親 保護
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.10,0:18:41.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 總之盡量收集資料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:44.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事後應該會有專家過來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:49.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼大的設施很難想像聯合會放著不管
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:52.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,巴特 加強周圍警戒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:53.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.71,0:18:57.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:18:59.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難以置信！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.93,0:19:05.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嘴上說協調者是違背自然的錯誤存在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:07.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自己卻幹這種事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:08.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:11.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,操縱遺傳因子是錯誤的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:13.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就不是嗎？就可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:19.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Blue Cosmos到底算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.94,0:19:21.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:26.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,蠢材 為什麼放她走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.95,0:19:33.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母親
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:46.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 MS1接近中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.57,0:19:47.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是Gaia
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:50.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一台？有後續嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.57,0:19:52.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目前還沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.77,0:19:54.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打什麼主意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:56.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護設施
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.99,0:19:58.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白嗎 阿斯蘭 真
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:19:59.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:08.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母親 保護
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.71,0:20:14.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:17.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,注意 真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.56,0:20:19.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果目的是破壞設施
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:21.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可能攜帶了什麼特殊裝備
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.78,0:20:28.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別把它破壞掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.20,0:20:34.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:55.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能破壞？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:58.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 能從下面包抄嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.49,0:20:59.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正在做
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.37,0:21:45.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.19,0:22:11.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是她？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.68,0:22:18.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,涙で滲んだこの宇宙を見上げるたび
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚い青さが胸を締め付けてく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,運命なら　悲しみの果てまで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戦い続けた意味を後に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life goes on　燃え上がる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,生命がある限り
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真実へ　自分さえ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見失いそう　それでも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life goes on　守りたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,心は砕かれて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本当の悲しみを知った瞳は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,愛に溢れて...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.06,0:23:25.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,語言傳達的是想法
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.37,0:23:29.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,過去的時光中這也是毫無疑問的真實
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.48,0:23:33.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但對於沒有過去的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.25,0:23:35.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都只是沒有意義的夢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:39.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,信任之心所找尋的 通向明天的路標是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.67,0:23:43.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:45.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,約定
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.31,0:23:49.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,守護最後的一線光芒 Freedom
